          "do": [
            { "do": "move", "from": "n10", "on": "goes in after it" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "say": "Thirty divided by ten is three, which leaves log base three of three.",
          "asks": ["What is 30 divided by 10?"],
          "do": [
            { "do": "write", "step": 5, "on": "which leaves" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "say": "The base is three and the number inside is three. Three to the power one is three, so the log is one.",
